      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks to your continued support, the title has reached 20,000 downloads including the Friend's Pass!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This means that over 10,000 pairs of the boys have left their home and started a short journey to the mountain. This is very emotional for me.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I will do my best to continue to maintain the trail so that even more players will challenge it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With this update, I have fixed a Steam achievement issue and rebalanced the controllability.",
